{"id": 4061, "title": "The Weather I Like", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "the-weather-i-like", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/4061_the-weather-i-like.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["在一家饭馆，有一位客人问服务员：\"请问，你知道明天的天气怎么样吗？”", "这位服务员笑着说：\"一定会是我喜欢的天气。”客人感到很奇怪，问：\"你怎么知道会是你喜欢的天气呢?”服务员回答：\"我喜欢用积极的态度去面对我遇到的事情。所以，虽然我不知道明天是什么天气，但是一定会是我喜欢的。”", "愉快的生活是由愉快的思想造成的。你的态度决定你的心情，影响你的健康，甚至改变你的命运。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["在一家飯館，有一位客人問服務員：\"請問，你知道明天的天氣怎麼樣嗎？”", "這位服務員笑著說：\"一定會是我喜歡的天氣。”客人感到很奇怪，問：\"你怎麼知道會是你喜歡的天氣呢?”服務員回答：\"我喜歡用積極的態度去面對我遇到的事情。所以，雖然我不知道明天是什麼天氣，但是一定會是我喜歡的。”", "愉快的生活是由愉快的思想造成的。你的態度決定你的心情，影響你的健康，甚至改變你的命運。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["zài yī jiā fàn guǎn， yǒu yī wèi kè rén wèn fú wù yuán：\" qǐng wèn， nǐ zhī dào míng tiān de tiān qì zěn me yàng ma？”", "zhè wèi fú wù yuán xiào zhe shuō：\" yī dìng huì shì wǒ xǐ huan de tiān qì。” kè rén gǎn dào hěn qí guài， wèn：\" nǐ zěn me zhī dào huì shì nǐ xǐ huan de tiān qì ne ?” fú wù yuán huí dá：\" wǒ xǐ huan yòng jī jí de tài dù qù miàn duì wǒ yù dào de shì qing。 suǒ yǐ， suī rán wǒ bù zhī dào míng tiān shì shén me tiān qì， dàn shì yī dìng huì shì wǒ xǐ huan de。”", "yú kuài de shēng huó shì yóu yú kuài de sī xiǎng zào chéng de。 nǐ de tài dù jué dìng nǐ de xīn qíng， yǐng xiǎng nǐ de jiàn kāng， shèn zhì gǎi biàn nǐ de mìng yùn。"], "english_paragraphs": ["In a restaurant, a customer asked the waiter: \"Excuse me, do you know what the weather will be like tomorrow?\"", "The waiter smiled and said: \"It will definitely be the weather I like.\" The guest felt strange and asked: \"How do you know it will be the weather you like?\" The waiter replied: \"I like to face the things I encounter with a positive attitude. So, although I don't know what the weather will be tomorrow, it will definitely be the weather I like.\"", "A happy life is caused by happy thoughts. Your attitude determines your mood, affects your health, and even changes your destiny."], "english_full": "In a restaurant, a customer asked the waiter: \"Excuse me, do you know what the weather will be like tomorrow?\"\n\nThe waiter smiled and said: \"It will definitely be the weather I like.\" The guest felt strange and asked: \"How do you know it will be the weather you like?\" The waiter replied: \"I like to face the things I encounter with a positive attitude. So, although I don't know what the weather will be tomorrow, it will definitely be the weather I like.\"\n\nA happy life is caused by happy thoughts. Your attitude determines your mood, affects your health, and even changes your destiny.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiā\" data-defn=\"classifier for families or businesses\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fàn guǎn\" data-defn=\"restaurant\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">饭馆</span><span class=\"tr\">飯館</span><rt>fàn guǎn</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wèi\" data-defn=\"classifier for people (honorific)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">位</span><span class=\"tr\">位</span><rt>wèi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kè rén\" data-defn=\"visitor / guest / customer / client\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">客人</span><span class=\"tr\">客人</span><rt>kè rén</rt></ruby><r